  characterProfile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fd6c30254485ad4b0aa1fa59a2c9162e, type: 2}
  characterName: Principal Smith
  characterPortrait: {fileID: 4382555452683144737, guid: 6affef330c821fdf48e762abae79fbed, type: 3}
  sentences:
  - I know school can be boring at your age
  - You just want to sleep and play video games or watch TV all day
  - I've been thinking, pondering even
  - And I've come to the conclusion
  - It is not accepteble
  - Skipping and coming late, doing the bare minimum
  - That is not how I want my students to behave
  - Take this as a final warning, Mika
  - This is the last time you're coming late to school
  - Before I will have to contact your mother
